03;N/A<sup>a</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">4 (2.2)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">6 (3.3)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1 (0.5)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">9 (4.9)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote1"><label/><p>CI=confidence interval. RON=Recepteur d'Origine Nantais. MET=<italic>c-met</italic> protein.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote2"><label>a</label><p>N/A: not applicable.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="tbl2" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">Prognostic significance of biological indicators and expression of RON and/or MET for human bladder cancer patients (multivariate Cox regression analysis)</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Recurrence</bold></th><th colspan="2" align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Survival</bold><hr/></th></tr><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Factors</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold><italic>P</italic>-value</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold><italic>P</italic>-value</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>RR (95&#x00025; CI)</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Grade</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.60</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.41</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Stage</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.14</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.05<sup>&#x0002a;</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.98 (1.25&#x02013;3.14)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Size</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.19</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.35</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Shape</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.85</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.60</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Multiplicity</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.88</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.009<sup>&#x0002a;</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">2.46 (1.19&#x02013;3.55)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">RON</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.28</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.04<sup>&#x0002a;</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">2.03 (1.08&#x02013;3.53)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">MET</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.40</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.06</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">RON/MET</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.38</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.03<sup>&#x0002a;</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">2.22 (1.19&#x02013;3.74)</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote3"><label/><p>CI=confidence interval. RON=Recepteur d'Origine Nantais. MET=<italic>c-met</italic> protein.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote4"><label>&#x0002a;</label><p><italic>P</italic>&#x02a7d;0.05.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>